// Least kept winning labeled hamming not equal to the upper central value.
// An empty difference set returns -1, not 0. A least of 0 stays 0.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE unel ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG unel rank

IMPULSE unel 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "unel" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
